Subject: [PATCH 1/5] [Bugfix][Spec Decode] Fix dynamic-SD draft decode capture

Keep autoregressive draft decode capture fixed at one token per request instead of deriving its graph shapes from the dynamic speculative-decoding schedule.

Assisted-by: OpenAI Codex
Signed-off-by: Jellow <49915976+CZT0@users.noreply.github.com>
---
